{
  "uid": "motor-fraude",
  "title": "Motor de fraude",
  "tags": ["motor-fraude"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Motor de fraude",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Painéis entram junto com cada serviço (specs 001–006). Já disponível: **Receiver** (spec 001), **Gestão de regras** (spec 002), **Perfil do cliente** (spec 003) e **Motor de detecção** (spec 004). Ainda por vir: p99 fim a fim do motor, alertas por severidade, lag de consumo, entregas por canal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Receiver (spec 001)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por segundo, por desfecho",
      "description": "ACCEPTED e DUPLICATE respondem 202. IN_FLIGHT e UNAVAILABLE respondem 503, RATE_LIMITED 429, REJECTED 400, UNAUTHORIZED 401, TOO_LARGE 413.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(receiver_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 da publicação no Kafka (até o ack)",
      "description": "Principal componente da latência do receiver. Meta do SC-001: p99 do receiver até 30 ms.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.03 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(receiver_publish_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(receiver_publish_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duplicatas barradas e reenvios em andamento (por segundo)",
      "description": "DUPLICATE: reenvio depois do ack do Kafka. IN_FLIGHT: reenvio enquanto a primeira ainda publicava.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_duplicates_blocked_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "duplicatas barradas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_in_flight_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "em andamento"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fail-open do Redis, por motivo (por segundo)",
      "description": "Redis lento (timeout de 5 ms) ou fora do ar: o receiver segue sem o escudo e o motor resolve a duplicata. Falhas de confirm e release também aparecem aqui.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(receiver_redis_failopen_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "fail-open: {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_redis_confirm_failures_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha no confirm"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_redis_release_failures_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha no release"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Gestão de regras (spec 002)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conjuntos publicados, por ação (últimos 5 min)",
      "description": "Cada ativação, sombra, desligamento, rollback ou mudança de scoring publica um conjunto novo. Aparece em zero desde a partida do serviço.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (action) (increase(rules_published_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas de compilação (últimos 5 min)",
      "description": "rule: a expressão de uma regra nova ou de uma nova versão não compilou (422 na criação). rule-set: o conjunto resultante não compilou e nada foi publicado.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(rules_compilation_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GET /v1/rule-sets/active: p50 e p99, por status",
      "description": "O que o motor consulta a cada 30 s, já com a autenticação. 304 = nada mudou. Meta do SC-002: p99 do 304 até 10 ms.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consultas do motor ao conjunto ativo (por segundo, por status)",
      "description": "Em regime, quase tudo é 304. Um 200 aparece quando uma versão nova é publicada.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Perfil do cliente (spec 003)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Eventos do CDC por segundo, por tabela e operação",
      "description": "r = leitura do snapshot, c = criação, u = atualização, d = remoção. invalid = evento malformado descartado (deve ficar em zero).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (table, op) (rate(customer_cdc_events_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{table}} {{op}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Perfis publicados por segundo, por tipo",
      "description": "profile = perfil novo ou atualizado em customer-profile.v1; tombstone = cliente removido (valor nulo na mesma chave).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 38 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(customer_profiles_published_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Atraso do CDC até o perfil publicado (p50 e p99)",
      "description": "Tempo entre o ts_ms do evento no banco e a publicação do perfil. A meta (SC-001) é p99 de até 5 s. Durante o snapshot inicial ou a reconstrução o atraso sobe: os eventos relidos são antigos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 46 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(customer_cdc_lag_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(customer_cdc_lag_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Motor de detecção (spec 004)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 54 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência fim a fim: p99 e p50 contra o SLO de 0,5 s",
      "description": "Do receivedAt (hora em que o receiver aceitou a transação) até a decisão publicada pelo motor. A linha vermelha é o SLO (p99 ≤ 500 ms).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 55 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "SLO" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(engine_e2e_latency_seconds_bucket[1m])))", "legendFormat": "p99" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(engine_e2e_latency_seconds_bucket[1m])))", "legendFormat": "p50" },
        { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "vector(0.5)", "legendFormat": "SLO" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Decisões por segundo, por severidade",
      "description": "NONE = sem alerta; MEDIUM e HIGH geram alerta em fraud-alerts.v1.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 55 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (severity) (rate(engine_decisions_total[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{severity}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disparos por regra agora × média das últimas 3 horas",
      "description": "Uma regra acima da própria média (linha tracejada) sugere falso positivo súbito: um threshold mal ajustado ou uma regra nova. Só regras ativas; as em sombra aparecem no painel seguinte.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 63 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [
        { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "média 3 h.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }] }
      ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (rule_id) (rate(engine_rule_hits_total{mode=\"active\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "agora {{rule_id}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "avg_over_time(sum by (rule_id) (rate(engine_rule_hits_total{mode=\"active\"}[5m]))[3h:5m])", "legendFormat": "média 3 h {{rule_id}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disparos de regras em sombra, por regra",
      "description": "Regras em sombra são avaliadas e registradas, mas não somam pontos nem geram alerta: servem para medir o efeito antes de ativar.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 63 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (rule_id) (rate(engine_rule_hits_total{mode=\"shadow\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{rule_id}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lag máximo do consumidor, por instância",
      "description": "Maior atraso entre as partições que a instância lê. O lag por partição só existe com métricas em nível DEBUG do Kafka Streams (mais custo); em INFO o Kafka expõe o máximo por consumidor.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 71 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max by (instance) (kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag_max{service=\"detection-engine\", client_id=~\".*StreamThread.*consumer\"})", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Versão e idade do conjunto de regras, por instância",
      "description": "Todas as instâncias devem mostrar a mesma versão pouco depois de uma ativação. A idade conta desde a publicação do conjunto.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 71 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0, "axisPlacement": "left" } }, "overrides": [
        { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "idade.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right" }] }
      ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "engine_ruleset_version", "legendFormat": "versão {{instance}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "engine_ruleset_age_seconds", "legendFormat": "idade {{instance}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duplicatas barradas, eventos atrasados, DLQ, contexto parcial e falhas de carga de regras (por segundo)",
      "description": "duplicatas = reenvios descartados pelo dedup; atrasados = occurredAt mais de 2 min antes do recebimento; DLQ = mensagens que não desserializam; parcial = decisões sem o perfil do cliente; falhas = conjunto de regras rejeitado (compile, invalid ou kafka). Tudo deveria ficar perto de zero.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 79 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(engine_duplicates_dropped_total[1m]))", "legendFormat": "duplicatas" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(engine_late_events_total[1m]))", "legendFormat": "atrasados" },
        { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(engine_dlq_total[1m]))", "legendFormat": "DLQ" },
